      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠠᠷᠢᠺᠥᠯᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>terigülekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>тэргүүлэх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>TERIGYLE-</transcript>
      <definition>[cf. tyrygyle-] v. i. To be at the head of; to lead, command; to outstrip, leave behind.</definition>
      <page>805</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠠᠷᠢᠺᠥᠯᠠᠭᠰᠡᠨ ᠰᠠᠶᠢᠳ</unicode>
          <transcript>--gsen said</transcript>
          <definition> Head minister, head official.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠠᠷᠢᠺᠥᠯᠠᠨ ᠦᠢᠯᠡᠳᠦᠭᠰᠡᠨ ᠺᠦᠮᠦᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n yiledygsen kymyn</transcript>
          <definition> Instigator, founder, initiator .</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠠᠷᠢᠺᠥᠯᠠᠵᠦ ᠢᠷᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--zy ireky</transcript>
          <definition> To come first, be the first to arrive .</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
